WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.802
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.903
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.138
And now if you don't mind,

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.939
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:09.042
Today is Halloween,

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.011
so if you like jump scares,
ghouls, and goblins,

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.614
then you just have to wait
eight more days.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.382
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.717
Until that.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.853
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.723
President Biden early voted
over the weekend in Delaware

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.493
because people his age
do everything early.

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.864
Voting two weeks before
the election, dinner at 4:30.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.200
Hell, his luggage is already
packed for Christmas vacation.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.869
[ Light laughter ]
That's right.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.603
President Biden voted
over the weekend,

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.972
and in the interest
of bipartisanship,

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.407
he voted for everyone.

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:42.609
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.677
"I like them all.
They're all good fellas."

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.579
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.048
Tesla's CEO Elon Musk last week

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:52.518
completed the $44 billion deal
to take control of Twitter.

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:54.520
And meanwhile, a lot
of his customers are still

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.856
trying to take control
of their Teslas.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.858
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.360
After completing the purchase of
Twitter on Thursday,

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.163
Elon Musk sent a tweet directed

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:04.863
at the social media company's
advertisers

00:01:04.863 --> 00:01:06.398
and said the platform

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:10.103
"obviously cannot become
a free-for-all hellscape."

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.438
No, but it could stay that.

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.440
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.742
During last week's
Pennsylvania Senate debate,

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.945
Republican candidate
Dr. Mehmet Oz said

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.414
that he thought the decisions
about abortion

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.116
should be left up to
"women, doctors,

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:25.351
local political leaders."

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.386
Though to be fair,
in some cases,

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:30.390
that local political leader
may be the father.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.926
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:35.862
Just statistically...

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.563
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:39.732
President Biden is reportedly
considering a plan to

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.434
use Guantanamo Bay
to house Haitian migrants.

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:44.236
Unfortunately
he's going to have to wait

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:46.573
another few days
to move them in.

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:49.908
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:53.179
And finally, yesterday was
National Candy Corn Day,

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.714
which makes today national

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.850
"there's still plenty
of candy corn day."

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.585
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:00.386
We're off and running.

